This repository configures and fronts the official draw.io Docker image.
It does not fork draw.io and it does not modify app.min.js. The editor is
pulled from Docker Hub at build time and started through its own
entrypoint. Only the configuration hooks draw.io itself provides are used:
PreConfig.js, PostConfig.js, DRAWIO_* environment variables, URL
parameters, and the embed protocol.

